message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "voro-tree-qa: quality checks for public tree registers (Baumkataster)"
abstract: "Quality checks for three public tree registers of the DACH region: Zurich (81 142 trees, CC0), Wien (233 082 records) and Berlin (962 545 records, full WFS harvest, dl-zero-de/2.0), measured against what each city states about its own data. Every step is a prediction committed before the code and the run, then an outcome with a verdict per point; a refuted step is followed by a diagnosis before anything is used. Version 0.2: Wien (M0 8/12, D1 2/4) and Berlin (M0 9/14, D0 3/8, D1 6/7) added; Zurich unchanged since 0.1."
type: software
